        "TileImage": "$($repository 9e85c891-9eb7-4f3c-8115-896bf54d979b).Image",
        "Description": "47,\r\rI have good news, and bad news, bad news first:\r\rYou have two more targets added to this mission, but you arent gaining any  extra  pay for your extra work.\r\rThe good news? Soders revealed that Mills  has been trying to weasel  his way closer to Providence, leaving you an opportunity to nip the growth in the bud. \r\rYouve been cleared to eliminate not only Mills, but his Bodyguard and only leverage over Alma, Gerard Mann, who also aspires to become a Providence operative.\r\rBest of Luck, 47",
